  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir for 1 minute",
    "Add the rinsed rice and stir to coat with the spice mixture",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the saucepan and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes",
    "Fluff the cooked rice with a fork and stir in the green olives"
